{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/journey_through.png?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/five_more_minutes.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck and strategize to defeat foes as you traverse videogame worlds. Choose between 3 unique starting genres, and combine them to create unstoppable combos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five more minutes is a love letter to growing up with the emotional support of our best friend: videogames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/choose_genre.png?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/characters.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each genre has its own set of unique cards, keepsakes, and strategies. Level up your character to gain more actions, health, and collect powerful mementos from your gaming adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/mix_them.png?t=1741689876\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/fusion.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuse genres to unlock powerful and forbidden combinations that break the rules of gaming... or the game itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/explore_worlds.png?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/maps.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through nostalgic worlds loaded directly from the memory cards of your gaming childhood!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367950?t=1741689876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/2847947e2bd16da4e427707f0b93931b854f712e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741689876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/c83e9b9e44b9e287da911e678153c432ac7834cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741689876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/c83e9b9e44b9e287da911e678153c432ac7834cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741689876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/journey_through.png?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/five_more_minutes.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your deck and strategize to defeat foes as you traverse videogame worlds. Choose between 3 unique starting genres, and combine them to create unstoppable combos! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five more minutes is a love letter to growing up with the emotional support of our best friend: videogames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/choose_genre.png?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/characters.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each genre has its own set of unique cards, keepsakes, and strategies. Level up your character to gain more actions, health, and collect powerful mementos from your gaming adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/mix_them.png?t=1741689876\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/fusion.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuse genres to unlock powerful and forbidden combinations that break the rules of gaming... or the game itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/explore_worlds.png?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/extras/maps.gif?t=1741689876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through nostalgic worlds loaded directly from the memory cards of your gaming childhood!</p>","developers":["PurpleTurtle"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367950/e8f93cc4a2acb3cdf7546bd8e4ebb53c546be15a/header.jpg?t=1741689876","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112796,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112796/movie480.mp4?t=1741678129","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112796/movie_max.mp4?t=1741678129"},"name":"Five More Minutes","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112796/a0ed51a